docstring:
This is what the deer does most of the time: it hunts for
sheeps. In the process, it might breed, die of hunger,
or die of old age.
@param field The field currently occupied.
@param newDeers A list to return newly born deers.

function:
public void act(List<Animal> newDeers)
    {
        incrementAge();
        incrementHunger();
        if(isAlive()) {

            if(rand.nextDouble() <= Get_Disease_Rate) {
                this.beInfected();
            }

            if(conditionOfBirth()) {
                giveBirth(newDeers);
            }                    
            // Move towards a source of food if found.
            infectAction();
            if(Disease_Cause_Die()) {
                setDead(); // die because od disease.
            }

            else { //if this animal do not die by disease, do things below
                Location newLocation = findFood();
                if(newLocation == null) { 
                    // No food found - try to move to a free location.
                    newLocation = getField().freeAdjacentLocation(getLocation());
                }
                // See if it was possible to move.
                 if(newLocation != null) {
                    setLocation(newLocation);
                }

                else {
                    // Overcrowding.
                    setDead();
                }
            }
        }
    }

