docstring:
This is what the Mouse does. It will either find food
or breed depending on the time of day.
@param newMice A list to return newly born Mice.

function:
public void act(List<Animal> newMice)
    {
        incrementAge();
        incrementHunger();
        if(isAlive() && SimulatorView.dayTime()) {
            // Try to move into a free location.
            Location newLocation = eat();
            if(newLocation == null) { 
                // No food found - try to move to a free location.
                newLocation = getField().freeAdjacentLocation(getLocation());
            }
            if(newLocation != null) {
                setLocation(newLocation);
            }
            else {
                // Overcrowding.
                setDead();
            }
        }
        else if(isAlive() && !SimulatorView.dayTime()) {
            isBreedable(newMice);
        }
    }

