docstring:
Calculates the probability that a fish will move based on
the time of day and if the fish has chlamajadia.
@param step the current step that the simulation is on

function:
protected double calculateMovementProbability(int step) {
        int indexToGet = step % 4;
        double movementProbability = likelihoodOfMoving.get(indexToGet);
        if(hasChlamajadia()) { // Chlamajadia (the fish disease) halves the likelihood of movement
            movementProbability /= 2;
        }
        movementProbability /= (climate+1);
        return movementProbability;
    }

docstring:
Inherited from superclass, it seaches area around the animal and we can modify the radius.
@param count radius of search
@param adjacent list of locations around the current location
@param previous list of the lcoations that have been checked

function:
protected Location findFood(int count, List<Location>  adjacent, List<Location> previous)
    {
        if (count < 0){
            return null;
        }

        List<Location> previousLocations = previous;

        Iterator<Location> it = adjacent.iterator();
        while(it.hasNext()) {
            Location where = it.next();
            Object animal = getField().getObjectAt(where);

            if(animal instanceof Wildebeest || animal instanceof Rhino || 
            animal instanceof Deer) {
                if(getField().adjacentLocations(getLocation()).contains(where)){
                    killAnimal((Animal) animal);
                }
                return where;
            }

            if(previousLocations.contains(where)){continue;}

            previousLocations.add(where);

            if (findFood(count - 1, getField().adjacentLocations(where), previousLocations)!= null){
                return where;
            }
        }
        return null;
    }

