docstring:
Controls the actions of a mork during the day
It ages, gets more hungry, can breed, hunt and get ill
@param newMorks A list to return newly born morks
@param season the current season

function:
@Override
    public void act(List<Animal> newMorks, Season season) {

        incrementAge();
        incrementHunger();

        if (isAlive()) {

            if (super.getSex() == 0)
                reproduce(newMorks, season);

            if (foodLevel < MAX_STOMACH_VALUE) {
                // Move towards a source of food if found.
                Location newLocation = eat(BASE_SCOPE_VISION + heightEffectsOnVisionScope());
                if (newLocation == null) {
                    // No food found - try to move to a free location.
                    newLocation = getField().freeAdjacentLocation(getLocation());
                }
                // See if it was possible to move.
                if (newLocation != null && isAlive()) {
                    setLocation(newLocation);
                } else {
                    // Overcrowding.
                    if (isAlive()) {
                        setDead();
                        super.destruct();
                    }
                }
            }

            if (isAlive())
                super.invokeImmuneSystem();

        }
    }

