This is what the rabbit does most of the time - it runs
around. Sometimes it will breed or die of old age.
@param newRabbits A list to return newly born rabbits.

function:
public void act(List<Animal> newRabbits, int time, Weather weather)
    {
        incrementAge();
        checkSickness();
        if(time > 6){
            incrementHunger();
            if(isAlive()) {
                meet(newRabbits, PREGNANCY_PROBABILITY);
                switch(weather){
                    case SUNNY:
                    case RAINY:
                        findFood();


                    case FOGGY:
                        Location newLocation = getField().freeAdjacentLocation(getLocation());

                        if(newLocation != null) {
                            setLocation(newLocation);
                        }
                        else {
                            // Overcrowding.
                            setDead();
                        }
                    break;

                    case STORMY:
                    break;
                }

            }
        }
    }

