docstring:
Get a shuffled list of the free adjacent locations in the required layout.
@param location Get locations adjacent to this.
@param layoutSearch the layout to get free location from
@return A list of free adjacent locations.

function:
public List<Location> getFreeAdjacentLocations(Location location, EnvironmentsLayout layoutSearch) {
        List<Location> free = new LinkedList<>();
        List<Location> adjacent = adjacentLocations(location);
        for (Location next : adjacent) {
            if (layoutSearch == EnvironmentsLayout.ANIMALS) {
                if (getLandAt(next).getAnimal() == null)
                    free.add(next);
            } else if (layoutSearch == EnvironmentsLayout.PLANTS) {
                if (getLandAt(next).getPlant() == null)
                    free.add(next);
            }
        }
        return free;
    }

