See opposite sex animal exists in adjacent location
get an iterator to safely look through each of the locations
if the object is an animal then use it to check if an animal (of equal type to this animal)
is of the opposite sex
@returns Boolean - whether animal of opposite sex exists

function:
private Boolean animalOfOppositeSexIsNear() 
    {
        // get nearby animals 
        List<Animal> animals = field.getNearbyAnimals(field, location);
        boolean found = false;
        // the animal that this animal mated with
        Animal mate = null; 
        for (Animal animal : animals) {
            found = (animal.animalType == this.animalType) && (animal.getIsMale() != this.isMale);
            mate = animal; // the last animal that this animal mated with (use this to infect)
        }
        // infect the mate
        infectMate(mate);
        return found;
    }

