docstring:
Look for herbivorous animals adjacent to the current location.
Only the first live herbivorous animal is eaten.
@return Where food was found, or null if it wasn't.

function:
private Location findFood()
    {
        Field field = getField();
        List<Location> adjacent = field.adjacentLocations(getLocation());
        Iterator<Location> it = adjacent.iterator();
        while(it.hasNext()) {
            Location where = it.next();
            Object creature = field.getObjectAt(where);

            if(creature instanceof Cattle) {
                Cattle cattle = (Cattle) creature;
                if(cattle.isAlive()) { 
                    cattle.setDead();
                    foodLevel = 2*MOUSE_FOOD_VALUE;
                    return where;
                }
            }
            if(creature instanceof Sheep) {
                Sheep sheep = (Sheep) creature;
                if(sheep.isAlive()) { 
                    sheep.setDead();
                    foodLevel = 2*MOUSE_FOOD_VALUE;
                    return where;
                }
            }
            if(creature instanceof Mouse) {
                Mouse mouse = (Mouse) creature;
                if(mouse.isAlive()) { 
                    mouse.setDead();
                    foodLevel = MOUSE_FOOD_VALUE;
                    return where;
                }
            }
        }
        return null;
    }

