docstring:
Iterate through the values to find the min food level
@param competingSpecies, hashMap that has animals as keys and their
food level as values.
@return the key of the min value

function:
private Animal compareFoodResource(HashMap<Animal,Integer> competingSpecies)
    {
        int min = Integer.MAX_VALUE;

        for (int value : competingSpecies.values()) {
            if (value <=  min){
                min = value;
            }
        } 

        for (Map.Entry <Animal, Integer> entry : competingSpecies.entrySet()){
            if(entry.getValue() == min){
                return entry.getKey();
            }
        }
        return null;

    }

