Determine whether the simulation is still viable.
I.e., should it continue to run.

@return true If there is more than one species alive.

function:
public boolean isViable(Field field)
    {
        // How many counts are non-zero.
        int nonZero = 0;
        if(!countsValid) {
            generateCounts(field);
        }
        for(Class key : animalCounters.keySet()) {
            Counter info = animalCounters.get(key);
            if(info.getCount() > 0) {
                nonZero++;
            }
        }
        for(Class key : plantCounters.keySet()) {
            Counter info = plantCounters.get(key);
            if(info.getCount() > 0) {
                nonZero++;
            }
        }
        return nonZero > 1;
    }

