docstring:
Look for coyotes and wolfs adjacent to the current location.
Only the first live coyote or wolf is eaten.
@return Where food was found, or null if it wasn't.

function:
private Location findFood()
    {
        Field field = getField();
        List<Location> adjacent = field.adjacentLocations(getLocation());
        Iterator<Location> it = adjacent.iterator();
        while(it.hasNext()) {
            Location where = it.next();
            Object animal = field.getObjectAt(where);
            if(animal instanceof Coyote) {
                Coyote coyote = (Coyote) animal;
                if(coyote.isAlive()) { 
                    coyote.setDead();
                    foodLevel = COYOTE_FOOD_VALUE;
                    return where;
                }
            }
            else if (animal instanceof Wolf) {
                Wolf wolf = (Wolf) animal;
                if(wolf.isAlive()) {
                    wolf.setDead();
                    foodLevel = WOLF_FOOD_VALUE;
                    return where;
                }
            } else if(animal == null) {
                return where;
            } else if(animal instanceof Grass) {
                Grass grass = (Grass) animal;
                grass.setDead();
                return where;
            }
        }
        return null;
    }

