docstring:
Look for pigs or sheeps adjacent to the current location.
Only the first live animal is eaten.
@return Where food was found, or null if it wasn't.

function:
private Location findFood()
   {
        Field field = getField();
        List<Location> adjacent = field.adjacentLocations(getLocation());
        Iterator<Location> it = adjacent.iterator();
        while(it.hasNext()) {
            Location where = it.next();
            Object animal = field.getObjectAt(where);
            if(animal instanceof Sheep) {
                Sheep sheep = (Sheep) animal;
                if(sheep.getDisease()){
                    this.setDisease(true);
                }
                //wolfs also eat sheep so competeForfood method is called
                competeForfood(sheep);
                if(sheep.isAlive()) { 
                    sheep.setDead();
                    return where;
                }
            }

            else if((animal instanceof Pig)){
                Pig pig = (Pig) animal;
                if(pig.getDisease()){
                    this.setDisease(true);
                }
                if(pig.isAlive()) { 
                    addFoodLevel(pig.getFoodValue());
                    pig.setDead();
                    return where;
                }
            }
        }
        return null;
    }

