docstring:
Look for rabbits adjacent to the current location.
Only the first live rabbit is eaten.
@return Where food was found, or null if it wasn't.
@override from actor super-class

function:
public Location findFood()
    {
        Field field = getField();
        if(this.isAlive()){
            List<Location> adjacent = field.adjacentLocations(getLocation());
            Iterator<Location> it = adjacent.iterator();
            while(it.hasNext()) {
                Location where = it.next();
                Object animal = field.getObjectAt(where);
                if(animal instanceof Gopher) {
                    Gopher gopher = (Gopher) animal;
                    if(gopher.getVirus()>=Virus && gopher.isAlive())
                    {
                        gopher.setDead();
                        this.setDead();
                    }
                    if(gopher.isAlive()) { 
                        gopher.setDead();
                        foodLevel = GOPHER_FOOD_VALUE;
                        return where;
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        return null;
    }

docstring:
Search for mating partners around a given animal object - if an animal of opposite sex is encountred, the method returns true
Additionally, if the mating partner is found and the animal that is searching is infected with the disease, pass on the disease
Offspring won't be affected
@param location The location of the animal
@param isMale Is the animal male/female?
@param isInfected Is the animal infected?
@return true if mating partner found, false otherwise

function:
public boolean isMatingPartnerAvailable(Location location, boolean isMale, boolean isInfected)
    {
        if(location != null) {
            int row = location.getRow();
            int col = location.getCol();
            for(int roffset = -1; roffset <= 1; roffset++) {
                int nextRow = row + roffset;
                if(nextRow >= 0 && nextRow < depth) {
                    for(int coffset = -1; coffset <= 1; coffset++) {
                        int nextCol = col + coffset;
                        // Exclude invalid locations and the original location.
                        if(nextCol >= 0 && nextCol < width && (roffset != 0 || coffset != 0)) {
                            Object object = getObjectAt(nextRow, nextCol);
                            if(object instanceof Animal) {
                                Animal animal = (Animal) object;
                                if(isMale == !(animal.isMale())) {
                                    //mating partner found
                                    //transmit disease if a given animal is infected
                                    //offspring is not affected
                                    if(isInfected) {
                                        animal.setInfected();
                                    }
                                    return true;
                                }
                                // else do nothing, check for all locations
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        return false; // mating partner not found
    }

