A female wolf can breed if it has reached the breeding age
and has a male partner of breeding age within the breeding radius.

@return true if the wolf can breed.

function:
private boolean canBreed() {
        if (!isFemale() || !hasBreedingAge()) return false;
        Field field = getField();
        for (int x = getLocation().getRow() - BREEDING_RADIUS + 1; x < getLocation().getRow() + BREEDING_RADIUS - 1; x++)
            for (int y = getLocation().getCol() - BREEDING_RADIUS + 1; y < getLocation().getCol() + BREEDING_RADIUS - 1; y++)
                if ((x >= 0 && x < field.getDepth() && y >= 0 && y < field.getWidth()) && field.getObjectAt(x, y) instanceof Wolf &&
                        !((Wolf) field.getObjectAt(x, y)).isFemale() && ((Wolf) field.getObjectAt(x, y)).hasBreedingAge())
                    return true;
        return false;
    }

