docstring:
Look for cockroach and foxes adjacent to the current location.
Only the first live cockroach or fox is eaten.
@return Where food was found, or null if it wasn't.

function:
private Location findFood()
    {
        Field field = getField();
        List<Location> adjacent = field.adjacentLocations(getLocation());
        Iterator<Location> it = adjacent.iterator();
        while(it.hasNext()) {
            Location where = it.next();
            Object animal = field.getObjectAt(where);
            if(animal instanceof Cockroach) {
                Cockroach cockroach = (Cockroach) animal;
                if(cockroach.isAlive()) { 
                    cockroach.setDead();
                    foodLevel = COCKROACH_FOOD_VALUE;
                    return where;
                }
            }
            if(animal instanceof Fox){
                Fox fox = (Fox) animal;
                if(fox.isAlive()) {
                    fox.setDead();
                    foodLevel = FOX_FOOD_VALUE;
                    return where;
                }
            }

        }
        return null;
    }

