This is what the RattleSnake does most of the time: it hunts for
KangarooRats, Lizards and Tarantula. In the process, it might breed, die of hunger,
or die of old age. It's breeding reduces in fog.
@param field The field currently occupied.
@param newRattleSnakes A list to return newly born RattleSnakes.
@param isNight A boolean value when true it is night time and RattleSnakes are dormant.
@param weather The current weather, effects birth of RattleSnakes.

function:
public void act(List<Species> newRattleSnakes, Boolean isNight, String weather)
    {
        if(!isNight){
            incrementAge();
            incrementHunger();

            if(isAlive()) {

                // Move towards a source of food if found.
                if(weather != "foggy"){
                    giveBirth(newRattleSnakes); 
                } else {
                    Random rand = new Random();
                    int chance = rand.nextInt(100);
                    if (chance > 45){
                        giveBirth(newRattleSnakes); 
                    }
                } 

                Location newLocation = findFood();
                if(newLocation == null) { 
                    // No food found - try to move to a free location.
                    newLocation = getField().freeAdjacentLocation(getLocation());
                }
                // See if it was possible to move.
                if(newLocation != null) {
                    setLocation(newLocation);
                }
                else {
                    // Overcrowding.
                    setDead();
                }

            }
        }
    }

