public void act(List<Animal> newCoyotes, int time, Weather weather)
    {
        incrementAge();
        checkSickness();
        if(time < 16 || time > 21){
            incrementHunger();
            if(isAlive()) {
                meet(newCoyotes, PREGNANCY_PROBABILITY);   
                switch(weather){
                    case SUNNY:
                    case RAINY:        
                        // Move towards a source of food if found.
                        Location newLocation = findFood();

                        if(newLocation == null) { 
                            // No food found - try to move to a free location.
                            newLocation = getField().freeAdjacentLocation(getLocation());
                        }
                        // See if it was possible to move.
                        if(newLocation != null) {
                        setLocation(newLocation);
                        }
                        else {
                            // Overcrowding.
                            setDead();
                        }  
                    break;

                    case STORMY:
                    case FOGGY:
                    break;
                }
          }
        }
    }

docstring:
Return a shuffled list of locations that are either free,
or have objects of the given class. This essentially ignores
the given class.

@param location   The location from which to find free locations.
@param range      The range to search for around the start location.
@param actorClass The class of objects to ignore.
@return A shuffled list of free locations.

function:
public List<Location> getAllFreeLocationsIgnoring(Location location, int range, Class<?> actorClass) {
        List<Location> free = new LinkedList<>();
        List<Location> adjacent = adjacentLocations(location, range);
        for (Location next : adjacent) {
            Object actor = getObjectAt(next);
            if (actor == null || actorClass.isInstance(actor)) {
                free.add(next);
            }
        }

        Collections.shuffle(free);
        return free;
    }

