docstring:
Get a shuffled list of the free adjacent locations (biased towards predators who should be
able to breed into a cell containing their prey)
@param location Get locations adjacent to this
@param prey the Animal subtypes to ignore when assessing if a cell is free
@return a list of valid adjacent locations

function:
public List<Location> getBiasedAdjacentLocations(Location location, Class<?>... prey)
    {
        List<Location> free = new LinkedList<>();
        List<Location> adjacent = adjacentLocations(location);
        for(Location next : adjacent) {
            boolean replace = false;
            Object occupant = getObjectAt(next);

            for(int i = 0; i < prey.length; i++) {
                if(occupant == null || prey[i].isAssignableFrom(occupant.getClass())) {
                    replace = true;
                }
            }
            if(replace) {
                free.add(next);
            }
        }
        return free;
    }

