Check whether or not this mice is to give birth at this step.
New births will be made into free adjacent locations.

@param newMices A list to return newly born mices.

function:
public void giveBirth(List<Animal> newMices)
    {
        // New mices are born into adjacent locations.
        Field field = getField();
        // Get a list of free adjacent locations.
        List<Location> adjacent = field.adjacentLocations(getLocation());
        Iterator<Location> it = adjacent.iterator();
        while(it.hasNext()) {
            Location where = it.next();
            Object animal = field.getAnimalAt(where);
            if (animal instanceof Mice) {
                Mice mice = (Mice) animal;
                // When male and female meet breeding
                if (mice.isAlive() && this.getGender() != mice.getGender()) {
                    int births = breed(BREEDING_PROBABILITY, MAX_CHILD, BREEDING_AGE);
                    // newly born mices will be put into free adjacent locations
                    List<Location> free = field.getFreeAnimalAdjacentLocations(getLocation());
                    for(int b = 0; b < births && free.size() > 0; b++) {
                        Location loc = free.remove(0);
                        Mice young = new Mice(false, field, loc);
                        newMices.add(young);
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }

